## Interface: 16001
## Title: MailPad
## Notes: The mailbox, controller first: opening a mailbox opens MailPad instead of Blizzard's window. Your mail as a list, open one to read, take from one mail or from all of them; the auction house's mail summed up. Send to your characters, recent names, friends or guild, with items, money or COD.
